    ct:end_char 2205 ;
    ct:exact_text """Exhibit 99.1   CONFIDENTIAL TREATMENT REQUESTED WITH RESPECT TO CERTAIN PORTIONS HEREOF DENOTED WITH "***"

MOBILE VIRTUAL NETWORK ENABLER HOSTING AGREEMENT

